  "details": "1. Open VRChat, open Launch Pad and click on the \"Here\" tab that shows the players in the world.\n\n2. Click on yourself, and expand the window to be in full screen.\n\n3. A page that looks like the \"Profile\" page opens but loads in the \"Social\" tab instead.\n\nFrom this menu we are unable to update our status (Online, Ask me etc) but can change our Trust Rank settings. When clicking on the Profile page now we are able to.\n\nInterestingly enough when clicking from the Social tab > In Instance and selecting ourselves, it redirects us to the Profile tab as it should.",
